From 6ee614adbddc638d7e76e9fabcf309f77ca01e7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grok <grok@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:41:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed the Mystery Gift app (overlay 74) into the
 translator

Opening Mystery Gift from the main menu loads overlay 74 then aborts at
[SS-MISSING] ov74_0222AE6C (Init). Mirror 0164 (Global Terminal / ov70):
seed overlay_74_thumb.s and the three app entry points
(ov74_0222AE6C/0222C2EC/0222CD94), and drop every ov74_ Missing() stub
whose body lives in that seeded file (58 total; Init callees were already
unstubbed).
---
 .../nitromain-perf/missing.c                  | 58 -------------------
 .../maploader/seed-files.json                 |  3 +-
 .../maploader/seeds.json                      |  5 +-
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)

